        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">A mass measurement assay measures an material&apos;s mass characteristic. A radioactivity detection assay measures the amount of radiation (alpha, beta or gamma ray emmissions) coming from a material.</obo:IAO_0000112>
